seg-109e8a920fc2 = The bundled <c1/> already carries <b>real TLEs</b> (two-line element sets): the Celestrak <c2/> snapshot of the operational GPS (Global Positioning System) constellation catalogued on 2021-07-28, { "30" } satellites, with <c3/>. Each satellite is propagated with SGP4/SDP4 (Simplified General Perturbations { "4" } / Simplified Deep-space Perturbations { "4" }), which is validated against the official AIAA (American Institute of Aeronautics and Astronautics) 2006-6753 vectors. The same snapshot is vendored as <c4/>, and <c5/> fetches a fresh one. Read section { "3" } before quoting a geometry number from it: that scenario propagates each satellite from its own epoch.

