seg-5e9056a30d53 = SGP4 propagates each satellite from <b>its own TLE epoch</b>, and <c1/> (in <c2/>) returns propagators only, so scenario time <c3/> is applied as <c4/> to every satellite independently. That is the right convention only if all the element sets in the file share an epoch.

